# Incorrigible Youths, a french vanilla creature: cast with Black Lotus mana, its characteristics as printed (power, toughness,
# keywords, colors, types, protection), then attacking Bot2, who has no creatures.
# Haste (CR 702.10b): it attacks the turn it comes under Bot1's control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus x2
Incorrigible Youths
Plains x21

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#2.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Incorrigible Youths.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Incorrigible Youths > Bot2)
[T2 Bot2.End]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Incorrigible Youths.Power = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Incorrigible Youths.Toughness = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Incorrigible Youths.Keywords = Haste
? Bot1.Battlefield.Incorrigible Youths.Colors = Red
? Bot1.Battlefield.Incorrigible Youths.Types = Creature
? Bot1.Battlefield.Incorrigible Youths.Subtypes = Vampire
? Bot1.Battlefield.Incorrigible Youths.Supertypes = (absent)
